---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const seo = {
  title: "About Me",
  description: "Learn more about Faisal Durbaa, his skills, and professional background."
};

const skills = ['Python', 'AI/ML', 'Prompt Engineering', 'Linux', 'HTML', 'TypeScript', 'MS Office', 'Data Analysis', 'Multilingualism'];
---
<Layout seo={seo}>
  <div class="pad pt-10 pb-20">
    <h1 class="disp text-ink text-[clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.5rem)]">About</h1>
    <div class="prose-sheet mt-6 space-y-5">
      <p>Hey there! I'm on a gap year from Harvard University, and passionate about the intersection of artificial intelligence, and human-computer interaction. My journey began with Python programming and quickly evolved into exploring machine learning algorithms, prompt engineering techniques, and security analysis.</p>
      <p>Currently, I'm diving deep into AI/ML research and exploring the fascinating world of prompt engineering. I believe that understanding how to effectively communicate with AI systems is becoming as crucial as traditional programming skills.</p>
      <p>When I'm not coding or studying, you'll find me experimenting with Linux systems, exploring new technologies, or working on web development projects. I'm particularly interested in how technology can solve real-world problems and make data more accessible and secure.</p>
      <p>As someone who believes that facts are powerful tools, I'm committed to using technology ethically and transparently. I'm always eager to collaborate on innovative projects and connect with fellow tech enthusiasts who share a passion for learning and building.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="disp text-ink text-4xl mt-16">Skills &amp; Interests</h2>
    <ul class="index mt-5 max-w-[70ch]">
      {skills.map((name: string) => (
        <li class="border-b border-rule px-3 py-3 text-lg">{name}</li>
      ))}
    </ul>

    <blockquote class="prose-sheet mt-16 border-t-2 border-ink pt-6 text-xl">
      <p>"The best managers are the great individual contributors, who never ever want to be a manager, but decide they have to be a manager because no one else is going to be able to do as good a job as them."</p>
      <cite class="lab mt-3 block not-italic text-muted">— Steve Jobs</cite>
    </blockquote>

    <p class="mt-12"><a href="/contact/" class="btn-solid">Get in Touch</a></p>
  </div>
</Layout>
